Third-party code in this repository
===================================

The Rust program in `src/`, the tests, and the tooling are MIT licensed; see
LICENSE.

`reference/csegment/` contains the original IPW-based C implementation, which is
not required to build or use the Rust program. It ships so that the reference
outputs in `tests/golden/` can be regenerated and any future divergence can be
debugged against the program that produced them.

