The segmentation algorithm those files implement is described in:

    Woodcock, C. and V. J. Harward. 1992. Nested-hierarchical scene models and
    image segmentation. International Journal of Remote Sensing 13(16):
    3167-3187.

No GPL-licensed code is distributed here. Two GCC headers
(`inc/PORT/linux/float.h` and `string.h`) were vendored in an earlier Linux
port of IPW and have been removed: `string.h` was never referenced, and the
build now uses the system `<float.h>` instead of the bundled copy. See
`reference/csegment/PORTING.md`.
